config BOOTLOADER_AI_PASSPORT_QEMU_SKIP_RECOVERY_HOOK
    bool "Skip AI Passport Recovery hold hook in QEMU"
    default n
    help
        QEMU holds GPIO0 in its boot strap state, which otherwise looks like
        the five-second physical UP-key Recovery hold. This option is for the
        isolated QEMU build only and must remain disabled for device firmware.
